      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-03-13_WidnesExaminer_art0137" n="art0137">
        <p>Vi-Cocoa is the Best Stimulating Beverage Known."</p>
        <p>MR. C. BELL, York-street, Pelaw-on-Tyne,'writes ;- " For many years I have been thinking it was my duty to give a testimonial as to the value of Vi-Cocoa. I consider it to be the most stimulating beverage that I have had the pleasure of taking. It creates a fine warm glow, so different to other beverages I have taken. For a. few years I was accustomed to take Tea as I went out to my work in the morning, which is as early as two o'clock a.m. I always felt chilly after getting into the air, and was troubled with a pain in the chest. For five or six years I have taken Vi-Cocoa, and instead of the above, I am in a fine warm glow, the result of taking Dr. Tibbles' Vi-Cocoa. I have now dis- charged a duty I have long thought of petforming. You can use this as you please. lam about 64 years of age, and am following my work every day as a miner. I attribute much to Vi-Cocoa for my present health."</p>
